1000 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Located at the junction of Shanghai\054 Jiangsu\054 and Zhejiang provinces and municipalities\054 the Water Town Living Room covers a planned area of \013\013approximately 35 square kilometers\054 centered on the origin of the Yangtze River Delta\056 It comprises \042one point\054 one core\054 three gardens\054 three areas\054 multiple villages\054 and a blue ring\054\042 with the three main themed gardens\024Jiangnan polder fields\054 mulberry\055dike\055fishpond systems\054 and water town wetlands\024embodying the fusion of millennia\055old agricultural wisdom and ecological concepts\056 This land serves as both a green hub of the Yangtze River Delta and a vibrant example of Jiangnan water town culture\056)
     /K [ 104 ]
     /P 1001 0 R
     /Pg 792 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
