1324 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Narrative photography is a style of photography that uses images to tell a story\054 convey emotions\054 or document a sequence of events beyond a single moment\056 Through composition\054 lighting\054 subject expression\054 and environmental details\054 it creates a complete visual context\054 allowing viewers to understand background\054 plot\054 and mood\056 Unlike simple documentary or portrait shots\054 it emphasizes logical coherence and emotional resonance\054 often used in editorial projects\054 photojournalism\054 visual storytelling\054 and brand campaigns to deliver deeper messages\056)
     /K [ 266 ]
     /P 1325 0 R
     /Pg 792 0 R
     /S /Span
